diff between the normal object and the constructor function objects 

⚡ Key Differences (IMPORTANT)
Feature	          Normal Object	    Constructor Function
Creation	      Manual	        Using new
Reusability	      ❌ No	          ✅ Yes
Multiple Object   ❌ Hard          ✅ Easy
Memory Usage      ❌ More	      ✅ Less (prototype)
Use Case	      Small data	    Large apps

the diff between the constructor and the inheritance are as follow 

🔥 Key Difference (VERY IMPORTANT)
"Feature"	      "Constructor"	             "Inheritance"
Purpose	           Create objects	         Share/reuse properties & methods
Role	           Blueprint	             Relationship
Usage	           new Person()	             Object.create() / extends
Focus	           Object creation	         Code reuse


"constructor" create the objects and inheritance allows objects to share and reuse behavior from the other object 


